			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Simplify binary and Tauri config naming to \"Mountain\"\n\nRevert verbose development identifiers to simple \"Mountain\" for binary/lib names in Cargo.toml, Tauri identifier (now \"land.editor.binary\"), and productName in tauri.conf.json. Also removes duplicate externalBin entry and deletes obsolete .Backup files.\n\nThis restores clean naming conventions while preserving all build settings and feature flags.",
