			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Add LRU cache for FindFiles and optimize dev_log for release\n\nImplement an LRU cache for FindFilesInWorkspace to reduce latency during\nfuzzy file matching. The cache uses a 2.5s TTL and 128-entry capacity with\nsimple eviction, short-circuiting repeated walks during Cmd+P typing bursts\nthat typically fire 5-10 calls in 200ms.\n\nAdditionally, gate the dev_log! macro body on cfg!(debug_assertions) so it\nbecomes a literal no-op in release builds via LLVM dead-code-elimination.\nThis removes the format!, IsEnabled lookup, file-sink write, and dedup-\nmutex lock from the hot IPC path while preserving compile-time type-checking\nof format arguments.\n\nAlso revert the verbose development naming back to simple \"Mountain\" for\nbinary, lib, identifier, and productName, and remove obsolete .Backup files.",
			"SHA": "5c123e3aa335f9078086b721f4fbbe75a1651167"
		}
	],
